    "id": "ACT-GRAM",
    "revision": 6,
    "title": "After repeated choices",
    "subtitle": "Learn, understand, and use a Mandarin pattern.",
    "context": "Use the introduced pattern in a bounded sentence. Other wording may be valid Chinese; this task checks this pattern and these words.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-GRAM-G-hsk5-choice-frames-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "After repeated choices",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "The repeated-action frame leads to an eventual common conclusion. In the acceptance frame, the other person’s chosen value is accepted; surrounding conditions still apply.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "选来选去都是这本书。",
                "pinyin": "xuǎn lái xuǎn qù dōushì zhè běn shū 。",
                "meaning": "After considering the options, it always comes back to this book.",
                "audio": "9b15e2de14fc4f1d0aad9cb7ce1bd9865d954348510fcec17c52372125aac45d"
              },
              {
                "text": "你选什么就是什么。",
                "pinyin": "nǐ xuǎn shénme jiùshì shénme 。",
                "meaning": "Whatever you choose is what we will take.",
                "audio": "9a3ae414e79dd72fbdcc0828638140f67d2e3fca11ffe1015f7dc29bc797644c"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "title": "Words used in this pattern",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "来",
                "pinyin": "lái",
                "meaning": "come",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "f4814bc785f40dad26e30055a32aa468e1b4e3b6a7f7622302f5e96b1319c0c2"
